LANGUAGE English

Book Study Ordered No Keep Looped
	Page ExploreStudyViaHall2 No Text
		Not Visible
		Triggered By @ExploreStudyViaHall2 When foundSarah
		
		exploredStudyViaHall2 = true
		exploredStudyViaFoyer = false
	End Page ExploreStudyViaHall2

	Page ExploreStudyViaHall2NoSarah
		Not Visible
		Triggered By @ExploreStudyViaHall2 When Not foundSarah
		
		Text """
			When you reach for the handle, something behind you pulls your
			attention. That painting behind you draws you too hard to
			continue exploring.
		"""

		Exit
	End Page ExploreStudyViaHall2NoSarah

	Page ExploreStudyViaFoyer No Text
		Not Visible
		Triggered By @ExploreStudyViaFoyer
		
		exploredStudyViaHall2 = false
		exploredStudyViaFoyer = true	
	End Page ExploreStudyViaFoyer

	Page ExploreStudy
		Prolog """
			A small plaque on this door reads <<Study.>>
		"""
		Button "Explore"
		
		Remove TokenExploreStudyViaFoyer, TokenExploreStudyViaHall2
		Add TileStudy, TokenDoorStudy!
		
		Text """
			The door opens smoothly, like it has been used recently. Behind it,
			you find a well-appointed study.

			Place the {c:TileStudy} tile and a door as indicated. Discard all
			Explore tokens leading to the explored area.
		"""
	
		exploredStudy = true
	End Page ExploreStudy

	Page PlaceExploreFoyer
		Not Visible When exploredFoyer

		Add TokenExploreFoyerViaStudy!
		
		Text """
			Next to you is a door that leads farther into the house. Place an
			Explore token as indicated.
		"""
	End Page PlaceExploreFoyer

	Page PlaceExploreLibrary
		Add TokenExploreLibraryViaStudy!

		Text """
			A door in the far corner has a small brass plaque that reads
			<<Library.>> Place an Explore token as indicated.
		"""
	End Page PlaceExploreLibrary
	
	Page PlaceHealingStone
		Add TokenSearchStudyHealingStone!

		Text """
			A large oak desk sits in the middle of the room. A dead plant and a
			mess of papers cover it. Place a Search token as indicated.
		"""
		
		Trigger @MoveOnExplore
		Exit
	End Page PlaceHealingStone
	
	Page SearchHealingStone
		Not Visible
		Triggered By @SearchStudyHealingStone
		
		Prolog """
			The desk is covered in loose papers, books, and what look like
			several ancient artifacts.
		"""
		Button "Search"
			
		Text QItemHealingStone """
			You find several poor-quality stone carvings in the junk on the
			desk. You sigh and turn away. But there is something about those
			artifacts. You turn back. You aren't sure why, but that ugly
			carving... you must have it. Gain the {c:QItemHealingStone} Unique
			Item, then discard this Search token.
		"""
		
		Remove TokenSearchStudyHealingStone
		
		foundHealingStone = true
		Exit
	End Page SearchHealingStone
End Book Study